ugging-port=9222`.\\n2. Check the `DevToolsActivePort` file in the user's default Chrome profile (`C:\\\\Users\\\\samsung\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\User Data\\\\DevToolsActivePort`).\\n3. Check that the debugging port is open.\\n4. Verify if multiple processes are listening on the port, and terminate extraneous processes if necessary.\\n\\nThe recording of this session is available in the conversation artifacts.\",\"Recipient\":\"9d34f1cc-2595-4c4a-962f-f853c3e22d4e\",\"toolAction\":\"Reporting connection error to parent\",\"toolSummary\":\"Report Chrome connection failure\"}","thinkingSignature":""}}}}